IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `P5-section-5`
IMPORT `P5-art-43-annex-vi`

-- Tests of Article 43 and Annex VI (layer 1). Expected values are hand-written from the text, never from the code.
-- Dates: Chapter III Section 5 applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113 second paragraph, keel fork F-113-groups, assumed): 1 August 2026 is before, 2 August 2026 is the day,
-- 1 September 2027 is after. An AI system placed on 3 December 2027 is not saved by Art 111(2); one placed on 1 January 2027 and not significantly changed is saved on
-- 2 December 2030 (and covered if it was significantly changed). The text as enacted applied only until 26 July 2026 and the group applies only from 2 August 2026, so
-- every as-enacted function is tested DIRECTLY (a dispatcher's as-enacted branch can never be reached through the gate: PLAN.md section 5).

`Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`

§ `Article 43(1): the conformity assessment procedure for point 1 of Annex III`

-- args: date asked, route, date placed, significantly changed, point of Annex III, (applied standards or specifications), (standards do not exist and specifications are not available),
--       (has not applied, or only part), (specifications exist but not applied), (standard published with a restriction)
-- Before the group applies: NOTHING (not applicable).
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- On the day and after: the provider applied standards and none of (a) to (d) holds, so the provider opts.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) option between the procedure of Annex VI and the procedure of Annex VII`
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) option between the procedure of Annex VI and the procedure of Annex VII`
-- (b) the provider has applied only part of the standard: Annex VII.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VII (quality management system and technical documentation, with a notified body)`
-- (b) the provider has not applied the standard at all: Annex VII.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VII (quality management system and technical documentation, with a notified body)`
-- (a) no standards exist and no common specifications are available: Annex VII.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VII (quality management system and technical documentation, with a notified body)`
-- (c) the common specifications exist but the provider has not applied them: Annex VII.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VII (quality management system and technical documentation, with a notified body)`
-- (d) a standard published with a restriction: Annex VII, and only on the restricted part.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) procedure of Annex VII for the restricted part of the harmonised standard only`
-- The provider applied no standard and none of (a) to (d) is stated to hold: the text is silent (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not point 1 of Annex III: the paragraph does not speak (NOTHING), whatever the facts.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 2 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 111(2): placed before the date of application of Chapter III and not significantly changed: saved (NOTHING).
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Significantly changed: covered.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE 1 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) option between the procedure of Annex VI and the procedure of Annex VII`

§§ `Article 43(1) third subparagraph: the notified body`

-- args: date asked, route, date placed, significantly changed, Annex VII is carried out, intended for law enforcement, immigration or asylum authorities or Union institutions
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The provider may choose any of the notified bodies.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) any notified body chosen by the provider`
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) any notified body chosen by the provider`
-- Intended for law enforcement and so on: the market surveillance authority acts as the notified body.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) the market surveillance authority referred to in Article 74(8) or (9)`
-- No Annex VII procedure is carried out: the sentence does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Saved by Art 111(2).
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Covered once significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 43(1) the body that carries out the conformity assessment procedure of Annex VII` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(1) the market surveillance authority referred to in Article 74(8) or (9)`

§ `Article 43(2): points 2 to 8 of Annex III`

-- Before the group applies: NOTHING.
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 2 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Point 2 of Annex III, on the day: the provider follows Annex VI.
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 2 EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VI (internal control)`
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VI (internal control)`
