#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 4 EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VI (internal control)`
