#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- A point beyond 8: the paragraph does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 9 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Saved by Art 111(2).
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE 3 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Covered once significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 43(2) the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE 3 EQUALS JUST `Art 43 procedure of Annex VI (internal control)`

§ `Article 43(3) first subparagraph: Section A of Annex I (the text as enacted and the text as amended)`

-- First sentence. The two versions are tested directly; the dispatcher takes: date asked, route, date placed, significantly changed, covered by Section A legislation.
-- As enacted, covered.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as enacted the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(3) procedure required by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I`
-- As enacted, not covered: the sentence does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as enacted the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- As amended, covered (same answer: the wording differs, the content does not: NOTES.md, Versions).
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as amended the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(3) procedure required by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I`
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as amended the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
