#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 26 7 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 27 7 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 8 2026) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- On the day: the version in force is the amended one.
