#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(3) procedure required by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I`
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 1 9 2027) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 3 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Saved by Art 111(2).
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Covered once significantly changed.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph the conformity assessment procedure the provider is to follow` (Date 2 12 2030) `Art 40 to 49 tests Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `Art 43(3) procedure required by the Union harmonisation legislation listed in Section A of Annex I`

-- Second sentence: the requirements of Section 2 apply and are part of the assessment (the same in both versions).
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as enacted the requirements set out in Section 2 apply to the high-risk AI system and are part of that assessment` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as enacted the requirements set out in Section 2 apply to the high-risk AI system and are part of that assessment` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) first subparagraph as amended the requirements set out in Section 2 apply to the high-risk AI system and are part of that assessment` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
