§§ `Article 43(3) second subparagraph: the power of a notified body`

-- As enacted: args are (notified under the Section A legislation), (compliance assessed in the notification procedure).
-- As enacted: notified and assessed: the power.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as enacted the notified body has the power to control the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The 'provided that' gate fails: a grant that is not made (NOTHING), not a statement that the body has no power.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as enacted the notified body has the power to control the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Not notified under the Section A legislation: the sentence does not speak.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as enacted the notified body has the power to control the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as enacted the notified body has the power to control the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- As amended: args are (notified), (assessed), (evidenced through the assessment as part of the existing notification).
-- As amended: notified, assessed and evidenced: the power.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as amended the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- As amended the gate has a second fact (evidenced as part of the existing notification): without it, no power.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as amended the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as amended the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as amended the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph as amended the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The dispatcher: date asked, notified, assessed, evidenced.
-- Before the group applies: NOTHING (a notified body is not an operator, so Art 111(2) does not save it).
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- On the day and after, the amended gate is used: 'evidenced' is required.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 9 2027) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Each side of 27 July 2026: before the group, so NOTHING on both.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) second subparagraph the notified body has the power to assess the conformity of the high-risk AI system with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Last sentence of the second subparagraph (as amended only): apply for designation by 28 January 2028.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) the date by which the notified body must apply for designation` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- From the day: the date is 28 January 2028.
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) the date by which the notified body must apply for designation` (Date 2 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 28 1 2028)
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) the date by which the notified body must apply for designation` (Date 1 9 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 28 1 2028)
