§§ `Article 43(3) third subparagraph: the product manufacturer's option`

-- First sentence, as enacted: args are (the legal act enables the opt-out), (applied all harmonised standards covering all the relevant requirements), (also applied standards or specifications covering Section 2).
-- As enacted: no such option in the legal act ('Where' gate): the text's own no (FALSE; split site (ii), fork F-43-3-opt).
#ASSERT `Art 43(3) third subparagraph as enacted the product manufacturer may use the option not to have a third-party conformity assessment` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
